{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-03-15 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES ISO 9001:2015 CERTIFICATION FOR ITS BRISTOL MANUFACTURING FACILITY.', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS, MARCH 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH), A GLOBAL LIFE SCIENCES COMPANY PROVIDING INNOVATIVE TOOLS AND BIOACTIVE REAGENTS FOR THE RESEARCH AND CLINICAL DIAGNOSTIC COMMUNITIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BRISTOL SITE IN THE UNITED KINGDOM RECEIVED ISO 9001:2015 QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEMS CERTIFICATION. BIO-TECHNE'S BRISTOL FACILITY PRODUCES LIFE SCIENCE REAGENTS FOR RESEARCH USE."}